activity Reject Copyright
activity Appeal Decision
bind File Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Patent Search: Application ID, Search Result
bind Examine Patent Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Patent: Application ID, Decision
bind Reject Patent: Application ID, Decision
bind File Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Trademark Search: Application ID, Search Result
bind Examine Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Trademark: Application ID, Decision
bind Reject Trademark: Application ID, Decision
bind File Copyright Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Examine Copyright Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Copyright: Application ID, Decision
bind Reject Copyright: Application ID, Decision
bind Appeal Decision: Application ID
Application ID: integer between 1 and 1000000
Application Fee: float between 50.0 and 10000.0
Application Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Search Result: Clear, Conflict
Decision: Grant, Reject
Response[File Patent Application, Examine Patent Application] | | |
Precedence[Examine Patent Application, Patent Search] | | |
Response[Patent Search, Examine Patent Application] |A.Search Result is Clear | |
Response[Examine Patent Application, Grant Patent] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Response[Examine Patent Application, Reject Patent] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Choice[Grant Patent, Reject Patent] | | |
Response[File Trademark Application, Examine Trademark Application] | | |
Precedence[Examine Trademark Application, Trademark Search] | | |
Response[Trademark Search, Examine Trademark Application] |A.Search Result is Clear | |
Response[Examine Trademark Application, Grant Trademark] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Response[Examine Trademark Application, Reject Trademark] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Choice[Grant Trademark, Reject Trademark] | | |
Response[File Copyright Application, Examine Copyright Application] | | |
Response[Examine Copyright Application, Grant Copyright] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Response[Examine Copyright Application, Reject Copyright] |A.Application Status is Rejected | |
Choice[Grant Copyright, Reject Copyright] | | |
Response[Reject Patent, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Response[Reject Trademark, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Response[Reject Copyright, Appeal Decision] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
End[Grant Patent] | |
End[Reject Patent] | |
End[Grant Trademark] | |
End[Reject Trademark] | |
End[Grant Copyright] | |
End[Reject Copyright] | |
Existence[File Patent Application] | |
Existence[File Trademark Application] | |
Existence[File Copyright Application] | |